NAME
       ssh-keygen - generate an SSH key pair

SYNOPSIS
       ssh-keygen

DESCRIPTION
       Creates an Ed25519 key pair in ~/.ssh, writing the private key
       to id_ed25519 and the public key to id_ed25519.pub, then prints
       the SHA-256 fingerprint.

       Append the public key to authorized_keys on the server to log in
       without a password.

FILES
       ~/.ssh/id_ed25519
       ~/.ssh/id_ed25519.pub

SEE ALSO
       ssh(1), sshd(1)
